From: eric-stone-plus <eric-stone-plus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:30:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(opencode): add automatic security gate and audit command

- Debounce edit/write/patch, hash the workspace diff, and run one bounded OCR
  review per hash with a security|bug critical/high filter.
- Inject one clearly-labelled [security-gate] note per session with stop rules.
- Add the /audit command and the code-audit skill for the manual/final path.
- Extend the plugin tests to cover the gate, filtering, nudge, and command.
